<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Pancaran debuts at 10.90 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Pancaran debuts at 10.90 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Pancaran Ikrab Bhd made their market debut at 10.90 ringgit against an offer price of 6.00.</p>
<p>The construction company offered three million vendor shares in its initial public offering.  </p>
<p>Around 20 minutes into the opening, the stock was at 10.10 ringgit on volume of 248,000 shares. It has traded between 10.0 and 10.90 ringgit.</p>
<p>Pancaran, which is listed on the second board of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange, estimated pretax earnings of 14.6 million ringgit for the year ended Septe,ber 30, 1996, against 12.4 million the previous year.</p>
